      en: ["Officially opened on October 17, 2018.", "The bridge's total length is 525 meters.", "Funded by a loan from the Japan International Cooperation Agency (JICA).", "It has a projected lifespan of 120 years.", "The bridge's pylon is 70 meters high.", "The first large-scale cable-stayed bridge in East Africa."],
