      en: ["Officially opened on October 5, 1962.", "The seat of Uganda's legislative branch.", "Opened just before Uganda's independence on October 9, 1962.", "Features a distinctive clock tower.", "Located on Parliament Avenue in Kampala.", "The architecture is of a mid-20th-century modern style."],
