      en: ["Officially opened in 2011.", "Located along the Mbarara-Masaka highway.", "The Eriijukiro Museum is the centre's core.", "Focuses on the culture of the Banyankole and Bakiga peoples.", "Showcases the importance of the Ankole long-horned cattle.", "The name 'Igongo' refers to a hill of historical importance."],
      es: ["Inaugurado en 2007", "Edificio principal de 1.200 metros cuadrados", "Colección de más de 500 objetos", "Ubicación: Mbarara, Uganda", "Ofrece talleres de arte tradicional", "Situado en una colina"],
      pt: ["Inaugurado em 2007", "Edifício principal com 1.200 metros quadrados", "Coleção de mais de 500 objetos", "Localização: Mbarara, Uganda", "Oferece workshops de arte tradicional", "Situado numa colina"],
      fr: ["Inauguré en 2007", "Bâtiment principal de 1 200 mètres carrés", "Collection de plus de 500 objets", "Lieu : Mbarara, Ouganda", "Propose des ateliers d'art traditionnel", "Situé sur une colline"],
