      en: ["Originally established in 1926 as a war memorial.", "Named after the Nakivubo river that flows through the area.", "The original capacity was approximately 30,000 spectators.", "Underwent a major redevelopment, increasing capacity to 35,000.", "Located adjacent to the bustling St. Balikuddembe Market.", "Hosted the final of the 1978 African Cup of Nations."],
      es: ["Construido en 1956", "Capacidad de 15.000 asientos", "Sede del SC Villa", "Renovación en 2018", "Sede de competiciones de la CAF", "Cuenta con pista de atletismo"],
